<title>ECUADOR: Ecuador's coffee export prices detailed.</title>
<headline>Ecuador's coffee export prices detailed.</headline>
<dateline>QUITO 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Here is a list of the minimum FOB reference prices for exporting 100-lb (45.36-kilo) sacks of Ecuadorean coffee, effective Dec 5 to 11:.</p>
<p>	 Washed arabic....................$ 101.53</p>
<p>	 Natural arabic...................$  96.93</p>
<p>	 Robust natural...................$  49.93</p>
<p>	 Roasted and/or ground............$  87.38</p>
</text>
